        <mxCell id="text_69" value="* Time / quality fields depend on firmware.&#10;Radar data format and host parsing to be fixed.&#10;Anchor USB bridge behavior to be verified.&#10;Hardware capability does not prove secure ranging.&#10;Hub distribution limits / backfeed unverified.&#10;Kalman / assignment methods are candidates.&#10;Prototype physical validation is in progress.&#10;Auxiliary demo only; closed-course only.&#10;Local grounds; no real-vehicle horn/headlamp wiring.&#10;No pole-to-vehicle cable; independent demo&#10;supplies." style="text;html=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=visible;rounded=0;spacing=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=22.2;fontColor=#28323D;fontStyle=0;lineHeight=1.22;" vertex="1" parent="open_issues" connectable="0">
